-    $$ T_{eye \to bg} = \exp\left(-\sigma_t (t_{max} - t_0)\right) $$
-    The initial accumulated radiance $L_{acc}$ is set to:
-    $$ L_{acc} = L_{bg} \cdot T_{eye \to bg} $$
