-        [S1, unofficial]
-
-    f.  **Phase Function:**
-        Evaluate the phase function $p(\omega_{in}, \omega_{out})$ for the direction from the light to the sample ($\omega_{in} = \mathbf{l}_{dir}/d_l$) and the view direction ($\omega_{out} = -\mathbf{d}$).
-        [S1, unofficial]
-
